WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.559
If we ask people which image 
they most associate&nbsp;with love,

00:00:04.559 --> 00:00:09.275
there's no question that the valentine
 heart would top the list.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:10.839
But what is this link?

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.446
Is it real or purely metaphorical?

00:00:14.446 --> 00:00:18.990
As a heart specialist, I'm here 
today to tell you

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.156
that this link is very real.

00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:26.754
Fear and grief, for example, can&nbsp;
cause profound cardiac injury.

00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:31.129
The nerves that control unconscious 
processes such&nbsp;as the heartbeat,

00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:37.890
can sense distress and trigger a 
maladaptive fight or flight response

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.495
that triggers&nbsp;blood vessels to constrict,

00:00:41.495 --> 00:00:45.621
the heart to gallop and blood pressure to rise,

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:47.084
resulting in damage.

00:00:47.084 --> 00:00:48.311
In other words,

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.552
it is increasingly clear

00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:56.638
that our hearts are&nbsp;extraordinarily 
sensitive to our emotional system.

